<section class="about-lead panel"><div class="about-symbol">✳</div><div><span class="eyebrow">THE BASICS</span><h2>What is COVID-19?</h2><p>COVID-19 is an infectious respiratory illness caused by the SARS-CoV-2 virus. Illness can range from mild to severe, and risk is higher for some people, including older adults and people with underlying conditions.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.who.int/news-room/fact-sheets/detail/coronavirus-disease-%28covid-19%29" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read the WHO fact sheet ↗</a></div></section>
<div class="info-grid"><section class="info-card"><span class="info-label"><span class="tiny-dot coral"></span> RECOGNIZE</span><h2>Common symptoms</h2><ul class="clean-list"><li>Fever or chills</li><li>Cough and sore throat</li><li>Fatigue or headache</li><li>Shortness of breath</li><li>Changes to taste or smell</li></ul><p class="micro-note">Symptoms can vary and overlap with other respiratory illnesses.</p></section>
<section class="info-card"><span class="info-label"><span class="tiny-dot green"></span> REDUCE RISK</span><h2>Practical prevention</h2><ul class="clean-list"><li>Stay home and away from others when unwell.</li><li>Improve indoor ventilation when practical.</li><li>Clean hands regularly and cover coughs.</li><li>Consider a well-fitting mask around others if you have symptoms.</li><li>Discuss vaccination with a qualified health professional.</li></ul></section>
<section class="info-card urgent-card"><span class="info-label"><span class="tiny-dot coral"></span> SEEK HELP</span><h2>When to get medical care</h2><p>Seek urgent medical attention for difficulty breathing, persistent chest pain or pressure, confusion, or other severe or worrying symptoms. Contact a health professional promptly if you are at higher risk.</p><a class="button ghost" href="https://www.who.int/news-room/questions-and-answers/item/coronavirus-disease-covid-19" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WHO questions &amp; answers ↗</a></section></div>
